Design a 4-bit wide exclusive OR (XOR) circuit. The module takes two 4-bit inputs, `a` and `b`, and produces a 4-bit output, `out`, where each bit of the output corresponds to the XOR operation between the corresponding bits of inputs `a` and `b`. The implementation uses a combinational logic block to compute the outputs based on the input values.
